<DocsExample TExample="WindowBasicExample" Title="Floating window" Description="NTWindow renders a draggable surface above the page. Bind Open to show and hide it; the close control sets Open to false." />
<DocsExample TExample="WindowStateExample" Title="Minimize and fullscreen" Description="Bind State to read or set Normal, Minimized or Fullscreen. DockPosition chooses where the minimized title bar docks." />
<DocsExample TExample="WindowFixedExample" Title="Fixed position" Description="Set Draggable to false for a window that stays where it opens, such as a pinned inspector, and use OnClosed to react to closing." />
